@startuml State_TOSS
[*] --> Pending : Order submitted by waiter

Pending --> Preparing : Kitchen accepts order
Preparing --> Ready : Kitchen marks item(s) ready
Ready --> Served : Waiter delivers order to table
Served --> BillRequested : Customer requests bill
BillRequested --> Paid : Payment processed
Paid --> Closed : Table freed

Pending --> Cancelled : Order cancelled before preparation
Preparing --> Cancelled : Order cancelled during preparation

note on link
  FR14: cancellation requires explicit
  confirmation from the waiter or manager.
  Not available once Ready or later.
end note

Cancelled --> [*]
Closed --> [*]
@enduml
